# copy this to model_guide.txt to give the LLM per-checkpoint prompt/settings
# guidance (same format as the original example_prompts_for_each_model.txt).
# Optional — without it the agent uses its built-in example style.

# ---- example entry ----
# novaAnimeXL_ilV190 (novaAnimeXL_ilV190.safetensors [fa486caafc])
#
# Prompt:
# masterpiece, best quality, amazing quality, very aesthetic, absurdres, newest,
# 1girl, solo, <character/subject tags>, <composition tags>, <lighting tags>,
# detailed background, depth of field
#
# Negative prompt:
# photorealistic, 3d, extra digits, multiple views, split view, lowres, bad anatomy,
# bad hands, worst quality, bad quality, sketch, jpeg artifacts, signature,
# watermark, (censored, bar_censor, mosaic_censor:1.2), simple background
#
# Settings:
# cfg_scale: 4.5, steps: 20, sampler_name: Euler a
# width: 832, height: 1216, clip_skip: 2
